<doc id="23840" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23840" title="Tulang tonggong">
Tulang tonggong

Dina &lt;a href="anatomi%20manusa"&gt;anatomi manusa&lt;/a&gt;, tulang tonggong hartina kolom nu disusun ku &lt;a href="vertebra"&gt;vertebra&lt;/a&gt;e, &lt;a href="sacrum"&gt;sacrum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cakram%20invertebral"&gt;cakram invertebral&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="coccyx"&gt;coccyx&lt;/a&gt; di bagian &lt;a href="dorsum%20%28biologi%29"&gt;dorsal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="torso"&gt;torso&lt;/a&gt;, anu dipisahkeun ku &lt;a href="cakram%20tulang%20tonggong"&gt;cakram tulang tonggong&lt;/a&gt;. Ieu kolom téh ngimahan &lt;a href="saraf%20tulang%20tonggong"&gt;saraf&lt;/a&gt; dina &lt;a href="kanal%20tulang%20tonggong"&gt;kanal tulang tonggong&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kurva</h2>
Kurva.
Tulang tonggong dibagi kana sababaraha kurva luyu jeung perenahna: &lt;a href="Cervical%20vertebrae"&gt;beuheung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Thoracic%20vertebrae"&gt;dada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lumbar%20vertebrae"&gt;cangkéng&lt;/a&gt;, jeung imbit.
<h3>Ngaran-ngaran vertebrae</h3>
Ngaran-ngaran vertebrae.
Unggal vertebrae dingaranan luyu jeung perenahna, ti luhur ka handap
Beuheung (sandina 'C' tina cervical) – 7 vertebrae (C1-C7)
<ul>
<li>C1 katelahna "atlas", nyambung jeung &lt;a href="tangkorak"&gt;tangkorak&lt;/a&gt;; C2 katelahna "aksis"</li>
<li>Possesses bifid spinous processes, which is absent in C7</li>
<li>Ukuranana leutik</li>
</ul>
Dada (sandina 'T' tina thoracic) – 12 vertebrae (T1-T12)
<ul>
<li>Ditangtukeun ku ayana costal facets for the articulation of the héads of ribs</li>
<li>Ukuranana sedeng, antara vertebra beuheung jeung cangkéng</li>
</ul>
Cangkéng (sandina 'L' tina lumbar) – 5 vertebrae (L1-L5)
<ul>
<li>Ukuranana badag</li>
<li>Teu boga costal facets nor transverse process foramina</li>
</ul>
Imbit kabagi dua:
<ul>
<li>Sacral – 5 (ngahiji) vertebrae (S1-S5)</li>
<li>Coccygeal – 4 (ngahiji) vertebrae (Co1-Co4)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Kanal tulang tonggong</h2>
Kanal tulang tonggong.
Kanal tulang tonggong (vertebral canal) nuturkeun kurva-kurva dina kolom; gedé bentuk segi tiga di bagian kolom anu bisa ojah loba, kayaning dina beuheung jeung cangkéng; leutik bentuk buleud di bagian dada anu teu bosa loba ojah.
